Sudoku Solver using SNN
=======================

This application runs the spiking-neural-network Sudoku solver from the NEST
Simulator examples (pynest/examples/sudoku) and wraps it in a web interface.

The network (backend/snn/sudoku_net.py) and the validation helpers ported into
backend/snn/helpers.py are part of NEST:

